# External skills installed into sbx's shared store by `brain sync-skills` (and `brain init`).
# One repo per line: <repo> [skill-name ...]   (no names = every skill in the repo)
# Private repos: sbx runs `git clone` on your Mac, so HTTPS works with `gh auth setup-git`.
